== (3) the lane's families ==
 8n+35 family: [27, 251, 2043, 16379, 131067, 1048571, 8388603] ; fixed point of n -> 8n+35 is -5; n_k = -5 mod 2^(3k): [True, True, True, True, True, True, True]
